        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b3f665/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-31T01:36:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think it would make sense that each RPG we play is essentially one of the many alternate universes in the multiverse. There will be certain similar paths we can all take, but each universe will be unique. How different is up to us in the end.</p>",
