      {
        "id": 153369,
        "name": "seesome",
        "username": "seesome",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/{size}/2018_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-02T14:21:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>IIRC, there was discussion that the SotM RPG would include a timeline of game history.&nbsp; I hope so because even if the official setting is just before \"the OblivAeon Event\" I may want to run a campaign in other times.&nbsp; I'd love to run some golden age SotM games with an earlier generations of heroes ad info about the past of the Sentinel's worlds would help with that.</p><p>Also, as a fan of Atomic Robo, I could easily see running a campaign that jumped around in time.</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
